/ An installed app's state in a word (DockerApp#status): running, stopped, installing, or one that
/ needs you (its install or its container failed: its page says why).
- case app.status
- when 'running'
  span.kai-pill.kai-pill-running Running
- when 'stopped'
  span.kai-pill.kai-pill-stopped Stopped
- when 'pulling', 'installing'
  span.kai-pill.kai-pill-busy Installing…
- when 'error'
  span.kai-pill.kai-pill-alert Needs attention
- else
  span.kai-pill = app.status.to_s.humanize
